   "data": {
    "text": "NOVA: XY PAD\n\n1. START, then \"XY pad\": the\n   pad opens at the bottom.\n2. Touch it: a note sounds\n   while the finger is down.\n3. Left/right: pitch\n4. Up/down: filter\n\nSilent until the pad is\ntouched."
   }
